<h3>KYC Process</h3>

<p>The first step involves filling up the activation form on the <a href="{{ $org['hostname']}}">Razorpay Dashboard</a>. The list of documents and details required for us to take you live can be found then in the <a href="{{ $org['hostname'] . '/#/app/activation'}}">Activation</a> panel. All requirements have a basic explanation alongside to help you through the process.

<p>This process is crucial as we share the same KYC with our partner banks who do their own due diligence. Also, signing up allows you to generate test keys from our dashboard which can be used for integrating payments in your product. You can just swap your test keys with your live keys once your account is activated.

<h3>Activation Timeline</h3>

<p>As soon as the KYC Process in completed by you, depending on the business segment, we will take you live in the upcoming 2-3 days.</p>

<p>
  Cheers,
  <br>
  Team Razorpay
</p>
